{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785994691747480001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"watery-steel-aim","assignee":"","author":"Iso Tester","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":6},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1782560953699195001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"2255ffe4-cdba-4964-be40-56a2c01f1212","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"1f19-adf2-ffb2-4b09"}],"description":"## Reproduction Steps\n1. Author a .rebar/workflows/X.yaml with an `agent` step that uses read_file/search_files.\n2. Run it via `rebar run-workflow` / MCP `run_workflow`.\n\n## Expected vs Actual\n- Expected: the agent reads a pinned-SHA snapshot (the raze-vet-ditch process).\n- Actual: rebar.workflow.runs.run() builds RunnerAgentStep(repo_root=...) with NO config and NO gate_read_root, so LLMConfig.from_env falls through to the server's mutable working tree (current_code_root unset). No ref/source param exists on run_workflow. It is also gated only by REBAR_MCP_READONLY, not REBAR_MCP_ALLOW_LLM — so a billable tool-using agent runs outside the LLM gate.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] run_workflow agent steps with file tools read a snapshot (attested) or are explicitly fail-closed when no ref/source is provided; never the mutable checkout silently.\n- [ ] run_workflow accepts/propagates ref/source (or sets the gate code root for the run).\n- [ ] run_workflow's live-agent path is fenced by REBAR_MCP_ALLOW_LLM.\n- [ ] A test reproduces the wrong-tree read and asserts the fix (snapshot or fail-closed).","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/runs.py","reason":"run_workflow gates LLM workflows + has_llm_steps"},{"path":"src/rebar/mcp_server.py","reason":"run_workflow ref/source + allow_llm fence"},{"path":"tests/interfaces/store/test_agent_op_safeguard.py","reason":"tests"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"36b45cc7-5d49-4cd7-ad37-74ae2b50a017","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"e95a-ccb9-743e-4d2c","ticket_type":"bug","title":"run_workflow agent steps bypass repo-snapshot isolation (read the mutable checkout)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["51e1c9e7-aee1-4c1e-9840-d0ddc2fd9b97","2255ffe4-cdba-4964-be40-56a2c01f1212","36b45cc7-5d49-4cd7-ad37-74ae2b50a017","1daebfa0-8402-499a-913b-b7a04c9b8bae","7c9f7fa9-0381-47ce-9b90-858ec63958e1","e4065667-9fdb-4889-a575-6a3ca4e2c10d"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785994691747480001,"uuid":"e3ddddbf-4c62-4ed5-bd2c-2f709a507840"}